  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Fungi emerge in the game as creeping invaders that spread silently across
    the battlefield. Fungi release spores that drift through the air, slowly infecting
    nearby defenses and weakening protective units over time. Unlike fast attackers,
    they rely on persistence, covering the ground with toxic growth and turning safe
    zones into dangerous territory. Their slow but steady advance forces players
    to respond quickly before the infection overwhelms everything.



    Fungi thrive
    in damp and neglected spaces, multiplying in clusters that become harder to eliminate
    once established. Fungi can corrupt nearby structures, reducing their effectiveness
    and allowing other enemies to push forward. Their presence creates pressure not
    through speed, but through continuous contamination. If ignored, they transform
    small footholds into widespread infestations that are difficult to reverse.



    Fungi
    can be countered by specialized medicines that target their cell walls and disrupt
    their growth. Antifungal defenders act as protective guardians, cleansing infected
    areas and restoring balance to the field. With the right treatment deployed at
    the right time, the creeping spread of Fungi can be contained. Players quickly
    learn that controlling the environment and applying proper medicine is the key
    to stopping their silent expansion.

'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3914de223fa8efc4787902589e5d6968, type: 2}
