  m_text: Pseudomonas aeruginosa appears in the game as a ruthless and highly adaptable
    enemy that thrives in harsh environments. It spreads through wounds and weakened
    systems, forming resilient colonies that are hard to eliminate. This pathogen
    releases toxic substances that slowly overwhelm defenses. Resistant and persistent,
    it refuses to retreat once established. Pseudomonas aeruginosa represents a dangerous
    late-game threat that punishes careless strategy.
