  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Protozoa emerges in the game as a cunning microscopic invader that advances
    steadily across the battlefield, seeking to infiltrate and weaken the body\u2019s
    defenses. Though single-celled, it is highly adaptable, capable of surviving
    in harsh conditions and exploiting any gap in protection. Protozoa functions
    as an attacking force, slipping past unguarded lines and draining strength over
    time if left unchecked.\r\n\r\nProtozoa thrives in environments where protection
    is poorly organized, multiplying quietly before launching a coordinated assault.
    Some variants move quickly, while others endure heavy damage, forcing players
    to carefully deploy the right medicine units to counter its advance. Its unpredictable
    behavior teaches that even the smallest enemy can become dangerous when underestimated.\r\n\r\nProtozoa
    can be controlled only when the correct treatments are positioned strategically
    to block and eliminate it. Antiprotozoal medicines act as guardians, forming
    a protective barrier that neutralizes its spread and restores balance to the
    system. Through its presence, Protozoa reminds players that precision, timing,
    and proper medication are essential to maintaining defense against microscopic
    threats.\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3914de223fa8efc4787902589e5d6968, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 4947494457033249829, guid: 3914de223fa8efc4787902589e5d6968, type: 2}
