  m_text: Haemophilus influenzae moves quietly across the battlefield, slipping through
    defenses and targeting the vulnerable with calculated precision. This fast-spreading
    bacterium weakens protective lines by causing respiratory assaults and sudden
    flare-ups, forcing players to respond quickly before it multiplies out of control.
    Though smaller and less intimidating at first glance, Haemophilus influenzae
    becomes dangerous when left unchecked, testing the strength and timing of the
    medicines deployed to block its advance and protect the frontline.
